[{"client_msg_id":"00648e82-9cbd-4365-a9c6-f5a23157d6a6","type":"message","user":"U01K7AWE26N","text":"iOSでGoogle DriveにAppが対応しないと利用できません。とか表示されて利用GoogleDriveつかえないんですよね...","ts":"1624359112.074800","thread_ts":"1623297490.097500","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U9lsK"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"408febd9-070d-44f9-a81c-b34db8899d90","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"Xmindを使って、データはgoogle drive等のクラウドストレージに保存しています","ts":"1623297490.097500","thread_ts":"1623297490.097500","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hvnq"}]}},{"type":"message","user":"U0236D3F5CZ","text":"\u003c@U0236D3F5CZ\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1624344269.073700","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UJV2VRS9X","text":"\u003c@UJV2VRS9X\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1624334764.073400","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"86ec6f47-11c8-4cec-b84f-76df208ffb5a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"（っていう話が上でなされていたのか。ちゃんと話の流れを見てなかった）","ts":"1624331531.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0737f334-4f0f-40ca-9cc1-d1f2dd07750f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"上のマッピングやってると、\nnnoremap gj j\nすら別になくてもいいんですよね。 1j ってやればデフォルトの j の挙動と同じになるので。","ts":"1624331435.072600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F53B0DB9-9D6C-4F4F-BC8D-853C9887B37C","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はgjにmapしてなかった","ts":"1624331344.071700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UFx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baa700a9-dd36-4ed8-9928-500961985fd8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"expr知ってるだけでマッピングの幅がかなり広がる","ts":"1624331333.071300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uzxMb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"096070ba-cf34-45ff-8aac-a2d77754c89d","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"このキーマッピングいいのは入力待ちが発生しないところですね。","ts":"1624331332.071200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V2i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76eae195-452f-40e2-9749-35a48bef694f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私もやろうかな。Vim script 書いてると、トレース情報に関数内の 20 行目、みたいな表記が割と出てきて、関数の先頭にカーソルを持っていって 20j とかよくやる (適切に改行を入れているので wrap が発生することがまずないので今の所問題にはなっていないが)","ts":"1624331148.069800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+YiUP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c4c2345-ca8a-457e-9614-4f7367fe2161","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私の場合は「ビジュアルモードでは、linewise-visual や blockwise-visual のときも j になるようにする」という設定が追加されてますね","ts":"1624331121.069500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UMRAUJY22"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L3Mb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5230350-a213-4caa-8eb0-42bde4e627ca","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もう解決済みかもですが、一応貼っておきますね\n```nnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; j v:count == 0 ? 'gj' : 'j'\nxnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; j (v:count == 0 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mode() ==# 'v') ? 'gj' : 'j'\nnnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; k v:count == 0 ? 'gk' : 'k'\nxnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; k (v:count == 0 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mode() ==# 'v') ? 'gk' : 'k'```\n","ts":"1624331057.067500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UMRAUJY22"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8f272bc-0410-45f1-8d39-700a0892975c","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"なんか個人的にVimレベル上がったきがします。ありがとうございます！","ts":"1624331009.066600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U03C71D7H","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TIbJ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37b26950-8b9e-4c40-903b-9c61f76e7d29","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あ、わたしそれやってます（ expr でカウントがあったらノーマルの j にして、それ以外なら gj ってやつ）","ts":"1624331009.066500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["UMRAUJY22"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xJsE2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3f9fed1-58b7-4284-88f4-11eb7c71ad8d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうです！その設定でキーの機能を入れ替えられます","ts":"1624330941.065400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MsEq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2956cb62-8391-426d-80e2-a466c39433ad","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"知らなかった・・。\nじゃあ\n```nnoremap gj j\nnnoremap j gj```\nは順不同で機能するものなんですね。","ts":"1624330918.065000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9aTPN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35a0105a-2560-4b86-9850-4ddf20c1cbe2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただ面倒なだけなので使うのであれば結局どこかにマッピングした方が良い気がしますw","ts":"1624330907.064800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0P2ZL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69628c39-848a-4f69-a25b-32bd964dd384","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Ex コマンドとして呼び出す方法も一応あります `:normal! j`","ts":"1624330857.063600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5f8b78e-0ca7-4f10-a51f-a01611d68930","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`noremap` 系の map は常に Vim 標準の機能を呼び出します","ts":"1624330769.062800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f58207e-af53-4349-af00-7087cee8a7ef","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"ちなみになんですが「j」のように元々vimに割り当てられた機能は,\n他キーに退避しない限りコマンドみたいに呼べないものなんでしょうか。","ts":"1624330708.062200","edited":{"user":"UMRAUJY22","ts":"1624330781.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7db56d7-1729-4db6-bbbf-2961802396b1","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"なるほど。いいですね！","ts":"1624330657.062000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2QeVi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e6617eb-d934-4aaa-ab98-46dfbc4ac063","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```noremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; 0 getline('.')[0 : col('.') - 2] =~# '^\\s\\+$' ? '0' : '^'```","ts":"1624330606.061200","thread_ts":"1624330606.061200","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IIhWV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71c77ebd-fcdd-479e-8984-46635e34a9a5","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"Yanoさんの0とても便利","ts":"1624330539.060400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rdr5h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdc805fe-7ded-438a-8a91-310ca7f86957","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"その場のコンテキストでマッピング切り替えたりとかもできるし","ts":"1624330510.059500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zkhD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6b7e22f-9026-46aa-adf8-12c91a75324b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"exprマッピングは楽しい","ts":"1624330491.059200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Azv8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a361f330-ad8d-4b69-aae5-b976a1fdbc08","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"おぉ、どちらでもやりたい事ができました。ありがとうございますっ\nexprのは面白いですね。マッピングの幅が広がりそうです。","ts":"1624330470.058700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUz6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b98ba1f-c043-4921-a790-dbd373769c4c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こんなやつ \u003chttps://github.com/rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking/blob/654f70a35efda6d141a53beacaf1db7bbfd2d2ca/plugin/mappings.vim#L4|https://github.com/rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking/blob/654f70a35efda6d141a53beacaf1db7bbfd2d2ca/plugin/mappings.vim#L4\u003e","ts":"1624330144.057100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking/blob/654f70a35efda6d141a53beacaf1db7bbfd2d2ca/plugin/mappings.vim | mappings.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking/blob/654f70a35efda6d141a53beacaf1db7bbfd2d2ca/plugin/mappings.vim | mappings.vim\u003e","text":"```\n\" Remap j/k to gj/gk only without a count.\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking|rusty1s/vim-happy-hacking\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FKolB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b540217c-4ceb-46f8-8aa7-190f87768ae2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"exprで判定できるんだ・・・","ts":"1624330030.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p5D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d9de21d-8ea9-4db3-a40c-4b3bef60d2dd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(手元にないので誰か頼んだ)","ts":"1624330022.056600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q3x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfb1f661-c280-41ce-853e-e6f0632753ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"exprでカウントがあるか判定して切り替えるというマッピングはよく見ますね","ts":"1624330013.056400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IuDb+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4defe23-7e5e-4d51-a7a2-3f5706410e43","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```nnoremap gj j```\nして10gjとかでできるかも？","ts":"1624329976.056300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["UMRAUJY22"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FtlU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef4612ff-0542-41a4-8f09-85eb23b4b111","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"見た目の表示と移動を合わせたいので以下のようにしているのですが、\n```nnoremap j gj```\n相対行表示で表示された数字の移動で、数字＋jを押すと見た目の行での移動になってしまいます(当然)\n\n設定をこのままで相対行移動の時だけ実際の行分移動する方法はないでしょうか。","ts":"1624329918.055500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FTzDL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a9d3155-0aea-46cd-9b3e-158e68e908a9","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"めちゃくちゃ亀レスで申し訳ないんですが、`getline('.')[0 : col('.') - 2]` で `col('.') - 2` しているのは改行文字を含まないためですか?","ts":"1624358426.074600","thread_ts":"1624330606.061200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DmtBe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7df60a8-d0d0-4323-9b7e-f50579b11af1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんかこれが行の情報を取得するテンプレみたいな話を聞いてそのまま使ってる感じですね\n自分は聞くまで知らなかったです","ts":"1624362604.075200","thread_ts":"1624330606.061200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vQ2d3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95245e9b-7171-4c03-8515-091b5530496d","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"そうなんですね。今ちょっとずつvim scriptを書いていこうと思ってたので気になったんです。\nありがとうございます。","ts":"1624367438.077400","thread_ts":"1624330606.061200","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fQv"}]}]
